# D27 companion of seq_r0_snap32_satellite_es13: one starformation_and_feedback call at the
# sequence's final substep (step 12 of effective_steps 13), with the full carried-value record.
# Input: the oracle-generated state entering that substep, obtained by chaining oracle_c05 single
# calls for substeps 0 .. 11 from seq_r0_snap32_satellite_es13.in (each call's recorded end state,
# bit for bit, is the next call's input); every other field as in seq_r0_snap32_satellite_es13.in.
# Its end state equals seq_r0_snap32_satellite_es13.out's.
# Provenance of the starting state, from seq_r0_snap32_satellite_es13.in:
# Every substep of an R0 satellite (galaxy 1) under its central (galaxy 0), effective_steps 13.
# galaxy 0: R0 reference model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 6d859a3a2ea422e3...) Snap_32 row 0, GalaxyIndex 0,
# Type 0
# galaxy 1: R0 reference model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 6d859a3a2ea422e3...) Snap_32 row 1, GalaxyIndex 28,
# Type 1
# End-of-snapshot output values used as plausible call inputs, not reconstructed call-time state;
# OutflowRate is the output converted back to code units times deltaT; the histories are zero, as
# at substep 0 after SAGE26's first-occupied reset (R/src/core_build_model.c:278-281).
